WEBVTT

00:11.500 --> 00:13.780
Do you think Mr. Lawrence will be all right?

00:13.780 --> 00:18.780
It'll be tough. He won't be able to put up 
a fight without a huge amount of pyrite.

00:19.160 --> 00:22.180
We can only hope that Diana 
will send someone for him.

00:23.880 --> 00:30.970
If he gets impatient and sells 
a middling number of stones,

00:30.970 --> 00:33.420
he'll just fan the greed of the buyers.

00:33.420 --> 00:36.410
If that happens, 
the price will keep going up.

00:36.800 --> 00:39.950
Then, won't Mr. Lawrence be pushed

00:39.950 --> 00:42.810
into making a move if Mr. Amati 
acts like he's about to sell?

00:42.810 --> 00:46.690
That's right. You're pretty smart.

00:49.530 --> 00:50.830
Where's Holo?

01:01.470 --> 01:03.000
Another buy tag!

01:03.000 --> 01:04.750
The value's gonna go up again.

01:05.790 --> 01:07.570
I should probably buy some now, too.

01:08.300 --> 01:09.950
Just how much higher will it rise?

01:11.460 --> 01:15.470
<b>Episode 19
God's Unseen Hand and Wolf's Unseen Heart</b>

01:13.800 --> 01:16.500
Wow, it's gone up that much?

01:16.500 --> 01:19.890
It'll probably go up twenty percent by noon.

01:19.890 --> 01:22.790
I should have bought some 
when I still had the chance.

01:24.820 --> 01:27.330
The price is creeping up.

01:27.330 --> 01:31.150
Amati currently has eight hundred 
silver coins worth of pyrite.

01:31.150 --> 01:32.980
If it goes up by twenty percent?

01:32.980 --> 01:34.760
It'll be worth nine hundred 
and sixty silver coins.

01:36.570 --> 01:42.300
If that happens, he'll probably sell all his 
assets to gather the remaining forty coins

01:42.300 --> 01:45.120
and complete the contract.

01:46.930 --> 01:50.880
He'll do it before the poison 
from the sale on credit takes effect.

01:51.320 --> 01:53.340
The poison from the sale on credit?

01:56.170 --> 01:59.030
Ms. Diana's representative still isn't here?

02:01.480 --> 02:03.860
If Holo has been by his side the whole time,

02:03.860 --> 02:06.680
Amati might have already 
gained a lot from her wisdom...

02:10.980 --> 02:12.360
Another buy tag!

02:12.990 --> 02:14.530
I can't believe it's gone up so much.

02:14.530 --> 02:16.860
No, I'm sure it'll still go up.

02:17.930 --> 02:19.340
How much is it now?

02:19.340 --> 02:20.990
All right! Keep going!

02:24.640 --> 02:25.690
This is bad.

02:32.090 --> 02:36.710
Did Ms. Diana make a contract with Amati?

02:37.060 --> 02:41.260
But won't Mr. Lawrence make 
a lot of money if Mr. Amati wins?

02:41.260 --> 02:42.830
You're right.

02:42.830 --> 02:45.620
Then, he succeeded as a merchant.

02:45.620 --> 02:48.010
But his losses will be great.

02:49.360 --> 02:53.690
There are things you can never obtain again, 
no matter how much money you make.

02:54.620 --> 02:55.950
Should we sell?

02:55.950 --> 02:57.250
No, we should wait a little longer.

02:57.250 --> 02:59.200
I'm sure it'll keep going up!

02:59.200 --> 03:03.200
You're interested in the alchemists' pyrite? {Note: Ep18}

03:03.540 --> 03:06.560
You didn't find a place to buy pyrite 
before signing the contract with him?! {Note: Ep17}

03:06.560 --> 03:08.830
Unfortunately, I didn't have enough time. {Note: Ep17}

03:08.830 --> 03:11.580
Someone else has already requested 
its purchase before you. {Note: Ep18}

03:11.850 --> 03:13.830
I will be the one to do the negotiations. {Note: Ep18}

03:13.830 --> 03:18.340
Where will I be sure to find you tomorrow? {Note: Ep18}

03:18.340 --> 03:19.740
The number of buyers isn’t going down.

03:19.740 --> 03:20.660
No sellers.

03:20.660 --> 03:21.890
Doesn't look good...

03:20.660 --> 03:21.890
It just keeps going up.

03:21.890 --> 03:23.550
Another buyer!

03:23.550 --> 03:25.540
Amazing. How much longer will it keep going?

03:24.390 --> 03:26.390
All right! Keep going!

03:26.060 --> 03:28.060
This isn't the time to be doing business deals!

03:28.060 --> 03:31.440
You thought a thousand silver coins 
would be worth the loss, did you not?! {Note: Ep 16}

03:37.440 --> 03:39.220
He's looking for her, too?

03:39.220 --> 03:39.860
A seller!

03:39.860 --> 03:41.240
Someone sold!

03:40.920 --> 03:41.990
Was it Amati?!

03:41.240 --> 03:41.990
For how much?

03:41.990 --> 03:43.320
How will the prices move?

03:45.210 --> 03:46.400
Excuse me!

03:46.400 --> 03:47.340
Please!

03:47.340 --> 03:48.800
Please let me through!

03:53.390 --> 03:55.330
Oh, um...

03:55.330 --> 03:56.920
Another buyer!

03:56.080 --> 03:58.620
It bounced right back...

03:58.620 --> 03:59.810
That was quick.

03:59.810 --> 04:02.400
It's not gonna stop rising.

04:00.180 --> 04:01.460
Will the price start moving?

04:01.470 --> 04:02.510
Is it time to sell?

04:02.510 --> 04:04.580
No, you should still buy.

04:02.660 --> 04:05.160
This has got to be as far as it goes.

04:04.580 --> 04:06.150
It's a little unusual today.

04:07.280 --> 04:08.060
Holo?!

04:08.400 --> 04:10.270
E-Excuse me.

04:11.580 --> 04:13.260
Oh, it's you.

04:13.260 --> 04:17.910
Someone came by our stall 
wanting to buy wheat with stones.

04:18.470 --> 04:19.370
How much?

04:19.370 --> 04:20.730
Two hundred and fifty coins worth.

04:23.320 --> 04:24.780
As much as you can, quickly.

04:24.780 --> 04:25.480
Yes!

04:29.330 --> 04:29.850
A seller!

04:29.850 --> 04:32.290
I need it to go up even more.

04:32.290 --> 04:33.690
The number of sellers is increasing.

04:33.690 --> 04:36.030
I'm buying! This is where it counts!

04:36.030 --> 04:37.880
The price isn't dropping!

04:39.920 --> 04:43.670
Amati bought five hundred coins 
worth of pyrite from Lawrence,

04:43.670 --> 04:46.560
but he has a contract 
instead of the actual product.

04:46.560 --> 04:49.360
He'll be delivering the actual 
product tomorrow evening.

04:54.620 --> 04:57.080
Do you understand what that means?

04:57.810 --> 05:00.770
He'll be able to sell the contract 
if the price seems to be rising,

05:00.770 --> 05:03.180
but not if it's dropping.

05:03.180 --> 05:04.570
That's right.

05:04.900 --> 05:07.410
No one wants to hold 
onto something that dangerous.

05:07.410 --> 05:11.650
If the price drops back down to normal,

05:11.650 --> 05:16.080
the contract he bought for five hundred 
silver becomes a worthless piece of paper.

05:17.540 --> 05:19.920
The final person with 
the contract will go bankrupt.

05:20.190 --> 05:23.990
That's right. That's why being sold 
on credit is so poisonous.

05:30.840 --> 05:32.690
Is this the limit?

05:32.690 --> 05:34.890
The patient ones will win out in the end.

05:33.630 --> 05:35.640
This price is good enough for me. I'm selling!

05:35.640 --> 05:38.060
Hurry up, Lant.

05:40.440 --> 05:42.020
It's time to sell.

05:41.300 --> 05:43.650
Ms. Holo? Ms. Holo?

05:42.020 --> 05:43.650
I should before the price drops any further...

05:44.960 --> 05:46.280
Another buyer!

05:46.280 --> 05:47.090
How much?

05:46.650 --> 05:48.000
I can't see! Don't crowd the front!

05:48.000 --> 05:49.790
It's a huge buyer!

05:52.070 --> 05:53.570
It went up again.

05:53.570 --> 05:55.080
Have I hit the limit?

05:54.540 --> 05:55.630
But will it keep going up?

05:55.630 --> 05:57.250
I'm sure this is as far as it'll go.

05:57.250 --> 05:59.750
There's a small number of buyers right now.

06:02.070 --> 06:03.980
If I sold everything I have...

06:05.880 --> 06:07.090
I'm selling!

06:07.090 --> 06:08.000
A seller.

06:08.000 --> 06:09.050
That much?

06:11.540 --> 06:12.750
The price dropped a lot.

06:12.750 --> 06:13.850
I missed the timing to sell...

06:13.850 --> 06:16.770
It'll go back up. We still have a chance!

06:27.470 --> 06:32.450
If I had Ms. Diana's four hundred coins 
worth of pyrite right now,

06:32.450 --> 06:35.120
the price would definitely crash.

06:41.240 --> 06:42.930
If she appears now...

06:42.930 --> 06:44.780
Mr. Lawrence!

06:48.270 --> 06:49.260
Mr. Lawrence.

06:49.770 --> 06:53.220
Sorry for the wait! 
Here's two hundred and fifty coins worth!

06:55.740 --> 06:57.060
What's wrong?

06:57.060 --> 06:58.760
Y-Yeah...

07:00.780 --> 07:04.730
To be safe, I should wait 
for Ms. Diana's representative...

07:04.730 --> 07:05.680
But...

07:06.450 --> 07:08.210
Is that person coming?

07:08.210 --> 07:08.900
Huh?

07:09.220 --> 07:10.040
That's right.

07:10.510 --> 07:13.900
I just gave up on that a moment ago.

07:14.900 --> 07:16.350
If I'm gambling...

07:18.750 --> 07:20.870
I need to sell before another buyer appears!

07:21.260 --> 07:22.000
Oh...

07:25.310 --> 07:26.990
Here it is! A big buyer!

07:26.990 --> 07:28.800
Hey, what's the price now?!

07:37.610 --> 07:38.810
It's a stabilizing buy!

07:38.810 --> 07:40.210
It went up again! 
It's the highest it's ever been!

07:40.210 --> 07:42.300
I'm going to buy! It's still time to buy!

07:40.690 --> 07:41.950
What's the matter?

07:41.950 --> 07:44.310
There's... another buyer.

07:45.250 --> 07:48.170
The winds have changed.

07:48.820 --> 07:52.500
Now, all I can do is wait 
for Ms. Diana's representative...

07:53.460 --> 07:54.990
L-Look!

07:59.410 --> 08:00.390
Holo!

08:02.450 --> 08:03.630
There's no mistake.

08:04.170 --> 08:06.890
Amati has realized the danger 
of being sold on credit.

08:08.190 --> 08:09.940
Oh, Mr. Lawrence!

08:11.960 --> 08:13.090
I'm out of time.

08:13.490 --> 08:15.080
Please, hurry.

08:15.080 --> 08:16.040
Please!

08:17.160 --> 08:19.720
Are you Mr. Lawrence?

08:22.020 --> 08:23.890
You're Mr. Lawrence, aren't you?

08:23.890 --> 08:25.790
Y-Yes.

08:25.790 --> 08:28.020
I have a message from Ms. Diana.

08:32.440 --> 08:34.300
She has failed in the negotiations.

08:36.680 --> 08:41.260
Ms. Diana says she has failed to convince 
the other party to sell to you.

08:43.100 --> 08:46.290
She also apologizes for being unable 
to meet your expectations.

08:48.590 --> 08:49.950
If you'll excuse me...

08:59.930 --> 09:01.400
Mr. Lawrence.

09:03.290 --> 09:04.430
Mr. Lawrence.

09:05.200 --> 09:06.690
Mr. Lawrence!

09:06.690 --> 09:08.440
Mr. Lawrence!

09:08.440 --> 09:10.330
O-Oh...

09:10.330 --> 09:11.630
Sorry.

09:11.630 --> 09:14.880
I caused you a lot of trouble...

09:14.880 --> 09:17.820
Huh? No, that's not...

09:17.820 --> 09:19.820
Please give Marc a message.

09:20.450 --> 09:23.450
The plan failed.

09:24.280 --> 09:27.290
Well, I'll get a thousand 
silver coins from Amati.

09:27.680 --> 09:30.440
As a merchant, I should be happy.

09:30.440 --> 09:32.420
Here, this is for you...

09:36.980 --> 09:38.360
Mr. Lawrence!

09:41.530 --> 09:43.220
A-Are you giving up?!

09:43.220 --> 09:47.890
Master has always told me that 
merchants should never give up easily.

09:47.890 --> 09:52.800
Th-The god of money 
doesn't come to those who pray,

09:52.800 --> 09:55.650
but to those who don't give up easily!

09:58.270 --> 10:00.050
I...

10:00.050 --> 10:03.990
I fell in love with Ms. Holo 
the moment I saw her!

10:04.900 --> 10:10.000
But Master told me that you would...

10:11.870 --> 10:13.670
beat me senseless if I told you!

10:16.350 --> 10:19.510
Yeah, someone's definitely in for a beating!

10:23.230 --> 10:25.060
I want to go all out...

10:26.310 --> 10:27.810
on myself.

10:30.560 --> 10:31.580
Huh?

10:31.580 --> 10:32.910
I forgot.

10:33.640 --> 10:39.820
People who don't give up easily 
are all unbelievably wishful thinkers.

10:40.530 --> 10:43.080
And I'm one of them.

10:43.530 --> 10:46.410
A merchant does business 
by making plans, predictions,

10:46.820 --> 10:49.290
and comparing those things against the facts.

10:49.710 --> 10:51.290
If I sell that, this'll happen.

10:51.290 --> 10:52.880
If I buy this, that'll happen.

10:52.880 --> 10:54.630
It's an important aspect of business.

10:55.200 --> 10:58.470
But people can make 
all the hypotheses they want.

10:58.780 --> 11:01.970
That's why you can get lost 
if you make too many of them.

11:01.970 --> 11:05.220
You start thinking that any business 
you do is full of dangers.

11:05.880 --> 11:09.420
That's why you need a guidepost.

11:10.270 --> 11:12.770
That is the one thing every merchant must have.

11:13.070 --> 11:15.150
If it's a trustworthy guidepost,

11:15.150 --> 11:17.530
you should have faith in it...

11:21.000 --> 11:23.240
no matter how crazy something seems.

11:27.060 --> 11:28.500
That's how it should be.

11:30.370 --> 11:34.540
Once I sell the pyrite, 
spread the rumor I asked you to spread.

11:35.800 --> 11:36.960
Y-Yes!

11:37.460 --> 11:39.060
Do you believe in God?

11:39.060 --> 11:39.710
Huh?

11:42.190 --> 11:43.160
I'm depending on you.

11:51.110 --> 11:52.310
You're here again.

11:55.640 --> 11:56.480
I'm selling.

12:01.320 --> 12:02.530
I am selling as well.

12:02.930 --> 12:03.980
Another seller?

12:03.300 --> 12:04.360
Fool.

12:03.980 --> 12:05.460
Hey, that amount...

12:05.960 --> 12:07.120
Sorry.

12:07.540 --> 12:10.890
Unlike someone else I know, 
she was a mature and beautiful lady, right?

12:08.190 --> 12:10.390
Hey, come and help!

12:19.130 --> 12:20.300
A seller!

12:20.300 --> 12:21.750
How much will the price change?

12:28.670 --> 12:30.310
It's a huge sale!

12:30.830 --> 12:31.710
Sell!

12:31.710 --> 12:32.860
I'm selling, too!

12:32.860 --> 12:34.600
Out of the way! Me first!

12:33.730 --> 12:36.250
Hey, shopkeeper! Come here quickly!

12:59.220 --> 13:02.840
In the end, Amati didn't lose 
too much financially,

13:03.170 --> 13:05.940
but it was a huge psychological blow to him.

13:09.230 --> 13:11.720
You shouldn't have tried 
to take another person's woman.

13:15.230 --> 13:17.100
That's what he was told.

13:19.310 --> 13:22.610
I had planned to break things off 
with him in a much harsher manner.

13:22.610 --> 13:23.700
Huh?

13:23.700 --> 13:26.730
I cannot forgive his words!

13:26.730 --> 13:27.470
What?

13:27.470 --> 13:29.620
Do not ask me what words he spoke.

13:30.110 --> 13:31.830
That's probably for the best.

13:33.650 --> 13:38.040
So? You cannot possibly think 
that everything has been resolved.

13:43.550 --> 13:44.690
I'm sorry.

13:44.690 --> 13:48.390
Do you truly know what
 you should be sorry for?

13:49.850 --> 13:50.730
I do.

13:53.910 --> 13:55.140
At least, I think so.

13:56.910 --> 14:04.300
My contract with Mr. Amati 
was a complete ego trip, right?

14:05.650 --> 14:10.910
And the worst thing was, 
I didn't completely trust you.

14:11.280 --> 14:13.380
You showed me the white feathers to tell me

14:13.380 --> 14:17.660
that you were the one 
who bought the pyrite from Ms. Diana.

14:17.940 --> 14:23.130
You disappeared because you 
were getting the pyrite from Ms. Diana.

14:23.130 --> 14:28.260
However, I thought you laid a trap for me 
when Amati sold some of his stones.

14:29.840 --> 14:31.860
Explain yourself!

14:33.210 --> 14:35.850
I thought you were trying 
to get me to play my hand...

14:36.280 --> 14:39.160
On top of that, if the price kept rising,

14:39.160 --> 14:43.520
I'd have to buy the pyrite 
I promised Amati at a higher price...

14:43.520 --> 14:47.030
I thought you had completely 
turned to Amati's side.

14:48.160 --> 14:49.390
But I was wrong.

14:49.390 --> 14:54.550
You instigated Amati, who isn't used 
to this kind of trade, to sell some.

14:54.990 --> 14:58.670
You were trying to tell me 
that Amati had enough stock,

14:58.670 --> 15:03.170
so I should hurry up and sell, right?

15:03.680 --> 15:05.060
Goodness...

15:07.020 --> 15:12.680
Even before that, you sent over 
the contract you signed that Amati prepared.

15:12.680 --> 15:13.550
That...

15:14.270 --> 15:18.180
That was to make me 
upset enough to take action...

15:20.390 --> 15:21.390
Wasn't it?

15:21.390 --> 15:24.650
I was on the second floor at the time...

15:27.140 --> 15:28.590
It is nothing.

15:28.590 --> 15:29.400
Continue!

15:32.160 --> 15:34.450
You told me in Ruvinheigen.

15:34.770 --> 15:38.450
I shouldn't try to play games 
and tell you how I truly feel.

15:38.820 --> 15:41.830
You told me problems are solved faster 
if we get angry and argue with one another.

15:42.590 --> 15:44.960
Then, we had our first misunderstanding.

15:45.310 --> 15:47.460
When you got upset 
about the issue with Yoitsu...

15:48.000 --> 15:50.220
The apology you gave me at the end...

15:50.220 --> 15:51.420
I am sorry. {Note: Ep16}

15:53.170 --> 15:55.600
I thought you were rejecting me.

15:56.040 --> 16:00.100
But you actually said that because 
you returned to your senses, right?

16:00.100 --> 16:01.810
You fool!

16:03.230 --> 16:06.590
This is what they mean when they say 
the thinking of a fool is a waste of time!

16:06.590 --> 16:09.760
You ruined all of my efforts!

16:09.760 --> 16:13.680
As if that were not enough, 
you thought I sided with the enemy?

16:13.680 --> 16:18.040
You were so obsessed with the contract
 you signed with that youngster!

16:18.040 --> 16:20.870
It is true that I met you only recently.

16:22.530 --> 16:27.260
Even so, I believed that we formed 
a bond that was far from shallow!

16:27.260 --> 16:30.010
Was that merely a one-sided assumption?

16:32.030 --> 16:35.430
Or could it be that you truly...

16:37.810 --> 16:40.190
I want to continue traveling with you.

16:50.520 --> 16:53.710
Until now, I've spent 
my entire life doing business.

16:53.710 --> 16:55.280
And I don't plan to change that.

16:55.660 --> 17:00.290
That's why I'm stupid 
when it comes to everything else.

17:02.810 --> 17:06.120
Even so, I want to travel with you.

17:07.250 --> 17:10.830
Then, what am I to you?

17:13.980 --> 17:16.190
No words can fully describe it.

17:21.240 --> 17:23.540
What kind of salty line was that?

17:23.540 --> 17:26.190
Don't you love jerky that's well salted?

17:27.740 --> 17:29.260
I hate it!

17:35.530 --> 17:38.090
There's something I also wanted to ask.

17:38.090 --> 17:38.950
Hm?

17:39.750 --> 17:44.080
How were you able to convince 
Ms. Diana to sell you the pyrite?

17:50.770 --> 17:57.480
I was able to figure out your plan 
from what that youngster told me.

17:57.960 --> 18:02.080
I was impressed you were able to think of 
something like that. You deserve my praise.

18:02.780 --> 18:05.410
And Diana...

18:05.410 --> 18:08.420
I visited her for a different reason.

18:08.420 --> 18:09.730
A different reason?

18:10.050 --> 18:12.580
I found her location 
from her scent on the letter.

18:12.980 --> 18:16.740
Though, I could hardly stand 
such a powerful smell of sulfur. {Note: Holo actually says the "smell of hot springs" which often has some sulfur in it. But I did not think the viewers would understand that, so I changed it to the actual smell.}

18:17.420 --> 18:18.990
I told her this.

18:19.460 --> 18:24.960
Invent a story that Yoitsu may still exist 
somewhere and tell that story to you.

18:25.720 --> 18:30.290
But that young girl refused my request.

18:30.290 --> 18:31.580
Is that so?

18:34.030 --> 18:35.320
Goodness.

18:35.320 --> 18:40.440
It was embarrassing, but I told her 
the situation and almost convinced her.

18:40.440 --> 18:41.760
Then, you appeared.

18:46.730 --> 18:48.140
Is anyone home? {Note: Ep 18}

18:48.400 --> 18:52.140
Then, that young girl 
thought of an unnecessary plan.

18:53.170 --> 18:56.570
She told me I should confirm 
the depth of your resolve.

18:56.970 --> 18:58.630
She spoke as if she knew everything...

18:58.990 --> 19:00.880
Yes, good night. {Note: Ep18}

19:00.880 --> 19:02.010
Excuse me. {Note: Ep18}

19:05.140 --> 19:06.300
Good luck. {Note: Ep18}

19:09.000 --> 19:13.630
I heard your foolish question 
clearly with my own ears.

19:16.910 --> 19:18.880
May I ask a question? {Note: Ep18}

19:18.880 --> 19:20.030
Feel free. {Note: Ep18}

19:20.620 --> 19:26.970
Are there any stories of pagan gods 
and humans becoming a couple? {Note: Ep18}

19:28.610 --> 19:29.360
Yes. {Note: Ep18}

19:30.090 --> 19:31.300
There are many. {Note: Ep18}

19:31.900 --> 19:36.200
It seems there are many stories 
about gods and humans becoming a couple.

19:37.150 --> 19:40.400
I do not mind, if that is what you wish.

19:41.070 --> 19:42.410
In exchange...

19:43.110 --> 19:44.810
please be gentle.

19:47.530 --> 19:49.250
I am joking.

19:49.250 --> 19:52.620
I cannot get in the mood 
after talking to that young girl.

19:55.680 --> 19:58.630
Did you realize that young girl is not human?

19:58.630 --> 19:59.550
Huh?

19:59.860 --> 20:02.720
There were a lot of feathers 
scattered in her room.

20:02.720 --> 20:04.430
Those are hers.

20:04.430 --> 20:05.730
Is that so?

20:05.730 --> 20:08.180
She was originally a bird much bigger than you.

20:08.180 --> 20:12.030
One day, she fell in love with a traveling monk

20:12.030 --> 20:14.690
and spent many years 
creating a church with him.

20:14.690 --> 20:19.190
The monk grew suspicious 
because the young girl never aged.

20:19.690 --> 20:22.200
I am sure you can guess what happened next.

20:33.650 --> 20:35.800
I wish to return to my hometown.

20:36.210 --> 20:39.180
Even if it is no longer there.

20:39.710 --> 20:40.500
Yeah.

20:52.730 --> 20:55.250
Humans do such flashy things.

20:55.250 --> 20:57.230
Yeah. It's amazing.

21:10.500 --> 21:12.380
We should join them.

21:12.380 --> 21:13.790
Good idea.

21:13.790 --> 21:18.730
I do not mind burning passionately 
like that straw figure, you know.

21:26.020 --> 21:28.890
That might work out 
if some alcohol gets involved.

21:29.240 --> 21:32.220
Who will care for me if <i>you</i> get drunk?!

21:32.690 --> 21:34.070
You fool!

23:44.980 --> 23:49.990
Episode 20

23:44.980 --> 23:49.990
Church Girl and Miller Boy

23:45.870 --> 23:49.540
Next Episode: Church Girl and Miller Boy.
